<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>풀매수 기원단: HODL or Die — PIXEL EDITION</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Press+Start+2P&family=VT323&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
/* ── PIXEL DESIGN SYSTEM ─────────────────────────────────── */
:root{
  --bg:#02040a;
  --panel:#080e1c;
  --panel2:#0c1428;
  --green:#00ff41;
  --green2:#00c832;
  --green-dim:#003a14;
  --red:#ff1a3c;
  --red2:#cc0028;
  --red-dim:#3a000e;
  --gold:#ffd700;
  --gold2:#e6a800;
  --purple:#9f5fff;
  --cyan:#00e5ff;
  --text:#d4deff;
  --muted:#4a5580;
  --line:#1a2240;
  --line2:#0f172a;
  --blue:#3d7bff;
}

.px-border{
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 2px var(--line),
    inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.04);
  image-rendering:pixelated;
}
.px-border-gold{
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 2px var(--gold2),
    0 0 0 4px #000,
    inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,215,0,.12);
}
.px-border-green{
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 2px var(--green2),
    0 0 0 4px #000,
    inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,255,65,.08);
}
.px-border-red{
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 2px var(--red2),
    0 0 0 4px #000;
}

*{box-sizing:border-box; image-rendering:pixelated;}
html,body{
  margin:0;padding:0;
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--text);
  font-family:'VT323',monospace;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}

/* ── CRT LAYER ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
body::before{
  content:'';
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:9999;
  pointer-events:none;
  background:repeating-linear-gradient(
    0deg,
    transparent,
    transparent 2px,
    rgba(0,0,0,.08) 2px,
    rgba(0,0,0,.08) 4px
  );
}
body::after{
  content:'';
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:9998;
  pointer-events:none;
  background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,transparent 60%,rgba(0,0,0,.55) 100%);
}

/* ── PIXEL BG CANVAS ─────────────────────────────────────── */
#candleBg{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;
  pointer-events:none;
  image-rendering:pixelated;
}

/* ── AMBIENT AMBIENT FLOATING BG CHARTS CONTAINER ────────── */
#bgChartContainer {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.ambient-chart-card {
  position: absolute;
  background: rgba(8, 14, 28, 0.78);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);
  box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.85);
  padding: 5px;
  font-family: 'Press Start 2P', monospace;
  font-size: 6px;
  color: var(--text);
  opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity 0.8s ease-in-out;
  image-rendering: pixelated;
  pointer-events: none;
  border-radius: 0;
  will-change: transform, opacity;
}

.ambient-chart-card.up { border-color: rgba(0, 255, 65, 0.4); }
.ambient-chart-card.down { border-color: rgba(255, 26, 60, 0.4); }

.ambient-hdr {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: 3px;
  font-size: 6px;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.ambient-hdr .sym { color: var(--gold); }
.ambient-hdr .chg-up { color: var(--green); }
.ambient-hdr .chg-down { color: var(--red); }

.ambient-canvas {
  display: block;
  image-rendering: pixelated;
  image-rendering: crisp-edges;
}

/* ── CABINET (MAIN UI CONTAINER) ────────────────────────── */
.cabinet{
  position:relative;
  max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;min-height:100vh;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#080e1c,#02040a 60%);
  border-left:3px solid #1a2240;
  border-right:3px solid #1a2240;
  box-shadow:0 0 80px rgba(0,0,0,.9) inset,0 0 2px var(--cyan) inset;
  overflow:hidden;z-index:1;
}

/* ── TAB NAV ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.tabnav{
  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;
  display:flex;
  background:#000;
  border-bottom:3px solid var(--line);
}
.tabnav button{
  flex:1;padding:10px 4px;
  background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;
  color:var(--muted);
  font-family:'Press Start 2P',monospace;
  font-size:7px;
  border-bottom:3px solid transparent;
  transition:none;
  letter-spacing:.02em;
}
.tabnav button.active{
  color:var(--gold);
  border-bottom-color:var(--gold);
  background:rgba(255,215,0,.05);
  text-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(255,215,0,.8);
}
.tabnav button:hover{color:var(--cyan);}

.screen{display:none;position:relative;z-index:1;min-height:calc(100vh - 40px);}
.screen.active{display:block;}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   01 TITLE
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
#screen-title{padding:28px 18px 24px;text-align:center;}

.eyebrow{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:9px;
  color:var(--red);
  letter-spacing:.06em;
  text-shadow:2px 2px 0 #8b0000, 0 0 10px var(--red);
  animation:blink 1.4s step-end infinite;
}
@keyframes blink{0%,100%{opacity:1;}50%{opacity:0;}}

.badge-wrap{position:relative;height:72px;margin:8px 0 0;}
.jibu-badge{
  position:absolute;top:0;right:12%;
  width:82px;height:82px;
  background:var(--red-dim);
  border:0 solid transparent;
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 3px var(--red),
    0 0 0 6px #000,
    0 0 0 8px var(--gold2),
    4px 4px 0 #000;
  border-radius:0;
  transform:rotate(12deg);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';color:var(--gold);font-size:10px;line-height:1.2;
  animation:badgeFloat 2.4s steps(4) infinite;
  cursor:default;
}
.jibu-badge span{font-size:7px;color:var(--text);margin-top:4px;}
@keyframes badgeFloat{
  0%{transform:rotate(12deg) translateY(0);}
  50%{transform:rotate(8deg) translateY(-5px);}
  100%{transform:rotate(12deg) translateY(0);}
}

.title-main{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';
  font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;
  margin:18px 0 4px;
  color:var(--green);
  text-shadow:
    3px 3px 0 #003a14,
    -1px -1px 0 #000,
    0 0 20px rgba(0,255,65,.5);
  letter-spacing:.03em;
}
.title-hodl{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';
  font-size:14px;
  color:var(--gold);
  text-shadow:
    2px 2px 0 #5c3d00,
    0 0 14px rgba(255,215,0,.6);
  margin-bottom:6px;
  letter-spacing:.05em;
}
.title-tagline{
  font-family:'VT323';font-size:20px;
  color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:22px;
}
.title-tagline b{color:var(--cyan);}

.menu{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:0 4px;}
.menu button{
  position:relative;padding:14px 16px;text-align:left;
  background:var(--panel);
  border:0 solid transparent;
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 2px var(--green2),
    4px 4px 0 #000;
  color:var(--text);
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:10px;
  cursor:pointer;
  border-radius:0;
  transition:none;
}
.menu button:hover{
  background:var(--green-dim);
  transform:translate(-2px,-2px);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--green),6px 6px 0 #000;
  color:var(--green);
}
.menu button:active{
  transform:translate(2px,2px);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--green2),2px 2px 0 #000;
}
.menu button small{
  display:block;font-family:'VT323';font-size:15px;
  color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px;
}

.ticker-wrap{
  margin-top:24px;
  border-top:3px solid var(--green-dim);
  border-bottom:3px solid var(--green-dim);
  padding:6px 0;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;
  background:#000;
}
.ticker{
  display:inline-block;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:9px;
  color:var(--green);
  text-shadow:0 0 4px rgba(0,255,65,.6);
  animation:scrollLeft 22s linear infinite;
}
@keyframes scrollLeft{from{transform:translateX(0);}to{transform:translateX(-50%);}}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   02 GAMEPLAY
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
#screen-play{padding:14px 14px 28px;}

.hdr{
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  margin-bottom:8px;
}
.hdr h2{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:9px;margin:0;
  color:var(--gold);
  text-shadow:1px 1px 0 #5c3d00;
}
.state-tag{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;
  color:var(--green);
  background:#000;
  border:0;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--green2),2px 2px 0 #000;
  padding:4px 7px;
}

.news-banner{
  background:#000;
  border:0;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--red2),2px 2px 0 #000;
  color:var(--gold);
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7.5px;
  padding:8px 10px;margin-bottom:10px;
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  line-height:1.8;
}
.news-title{color:var(--red);text-shadow:0 0 6px var(--red);}

.balance-main{
  background:var(--panel);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--gold2),0 0 0 4px #000,4px 4px 0 #000;
  padding:10px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:10px;
}
.balance-main .label{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;color:var(--muted);
  letter-spacing:.05em;
}
.balance-main .total{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:19px;
  color:var(--green);margin-top:6px;
  text-shadow:2px 2px 0 #003a14, 0 0 12px rgba(0,255,65,.5);
}

.assets-grid{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;
}
.asset-card{
  background:var(--panel);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--line),2px 2px 0 #000;
  padding:8px;text-align:center;
}
.asset-card .label{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:6.5px;color:var(--muted);
  margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:.03em;
}
.asset-card .val{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:11px;color:var(--text);
}
.asset-card .val.highlight{color:var(--gold);}

/* ── PIXEL CANDLESTICK CHART ─────────────────────────────── */
.chart-box{
  position:relative;height:164px;
  background:#000;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--cyan),0 0 0 4px #000,4px 4px 0 #000;
  margin-bottom:12px;overflow:hidden;
}
.chart-box canvas{
  width:100%;height:100%;display:block;
  image-rendering:pixelated;
  image-rendering:crisp-edges;
}
.chart-header{
  position:absolute;top:5px;left:8px;z-index:10;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;color:var(--muted);
  text-shadow:1px 1px 0 #000;
}
.chart-header span{color:var(--cyan);text-shadow:0 0 6px var(--cyan);}
.chart-header .ch-name{color:var(--gold);text-shadow:1px 1px 0 #000;}
.chart-header .ch-chg.pnl-up{color:var(--green);text-shadow:none;}
.chart-header .ch-chg.pnl-down{color:var(--red);text-shadow:none;}
.chart-back{
  position:absolute;top:5px;right:8px;z-index:10;border:none;cursor:pointer;
  background:#000;color:var(--cyan);font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;padding:4px 6px;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--cyan),2px 2px 0 #000;
}
.chart-back:hover{background:var(--panel2);}
.chart-back[hidden]{display:none;}
.quote-row{cursor:pointer;}
.quote-row:hover{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--muted);}
.quote-row.charted{background:var(--panel2);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--cyan),3px 3px 0 #000;}

.section-title{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:8px;
  color:var(--gold);
  margin:12px 0 6px;
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;
  text-shadow:1px 1px 0 #5c3d00;
}
.section-title span:last-child{
  font-size:7px;color:var(--muted);
}

.hand{display:flex;gap:8px;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:10px;}
.hand::-webkit-scrollbar{height:4px;background:#000;}
.hand::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--gold2);}

.card{
  --cc:var(--gold2);                 /* 카드 종류 색 */
  position:relative;
  width:108px;min-width:108px;height:158px;
  background:var(--panel2);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--cc),0 0 0 4px #000,3px 3px 0 #000;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;
  padding:7px 7px 6px;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;
  color:var(--text);cursor:pointer;flex-shrink:0;
  transition:none;
}
.card:hover{
  background:var(--panel);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--cc),0 0 0 4px #000,5px 5px 0 #000;
  transform:translate(-2px,-2px);
}
.card:active{transform:translate(2px,2px);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--cc),1px 1px 0 #000;}
.card::before,.card::after{
  content:'';position:absolute;width:6px;height:6px;
  border-color:var(--cc);border-style:solid;
}
.card::before{top:2px;left:2px;border-width:2px 0 0 2px;}
.card::after{bottom:2px;right:2px;border-width:0 2px 2px 0;}

.card.t-buy{--cc:var(--green2);}
.card.t-sell{--cc:var(--red2);}
.card.t-hold{--cc:var(--cyan);}
.card.t-action{--cc:var(--purple);}
.card.t-defense{--cc:var(--blue);}
.card.t-status{--cc:var(--muted);cursor:not-allowed;}

.c-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;}
.c-ap{background:var(--cc);color:#000;padding:2px 4px;font-size:8px;}
.c-type{color:var(--cc);font-size:6px;}
.card .sym{font-size:9px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--text);text-align:center;text-shadow:1px 1px 0 #000;}
.c-cost{font-size:8px;color:var(--gold);text-align:center;}
.c-price{font-size:6.5px;color:var(--cyan);text-align:center;}
.c-desc{flex:1;overflow:hidden;font-family:'VT323';font-size:14px;line-height:1.05;color:var(--text);opacity:.8;text-align:center;}
.c-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:4px;font-size:5.5px;color:var(--muted);}
.c-rar.uncommon{color:var(--cyan);}
.c-rar.legendary{color:var(--gold);}

.card.disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed;}
.card.disabled:hover{background:var(--panel2);transform:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--cc),0 0 0 4px #000,3px 3px 0 #000;}
.card.selected{
  background:var(--panel);transform:translate(-2px,-5px);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--gold),0 0 0 4px #000,5px 7px 0 #000;
}

.positions-wrap{
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;
  max-height:130px;overflow-y:auto;margin-bottom:10px;
}
.positions-wrap::-webkit-scrollbar{width:4px;background:#000;}
.positions-wrap::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--muted);}

.pos-item{
  background:var(--panel);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--line),2px 2px 0 #000;
  padding:7px 9px;
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;
}
.pos-info .name{font-size:9px;color:var(--text);}
.pos-info .detail{font-size:6.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px;}
.pos-pnl{text-align:right;}
.pos-pnl .val{font-weight:bold;font-size:8px;}
.pnl-up{color:var(--green);text-shadow:1px 1px 0 #003a14;}
.pnl-down{color:var(--red);text-shadow:1px 1px 0 #5c0010;}

.sell-btn{
  background:var(--red-dim);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--red2),2px 2px 0 #000;
  color:var(--text);
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;
  padding:4px 7px;cursor:pointer;
  border:none;margin-left:8px;
  border-radius:0;
}
.sell-btn:hover{background:var(--red2);transform:translate(-1px,-1px);}
.sell-btn:active{transform:translate(1px,1px);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--red2),1px 1px 0 #000;}

.sell-all-btn{
  width:100%;padding:14px;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:11px;
  background:var(--red-dim);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--red),0 0 0 4px #000,5px 5px 0 #000;
  color:var(--gold);border:none;
  cursor:pointer;letter-spacing:.05em;
  text-shadow:2px 2px 0 #5c0010;
  border-radius:0;
  transition:none;
}
.sell-all-btn:hover{
  background:var(--red2);
  transform:translate(-2px,-2px);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--red),0 0 0 4px #000,7px 7px 0 #000;
}
.sell-all-btn:active{
  transform:translate(3px,3px);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--red2),2px 2px 0 #000;
}

.popnum{
  position:absolute;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:11px;
  pointer-events:none;z-index:10;
  animation:pixelPop .9s steps(8) forwards;
  image-rendering:pixelated;
}
@keyframes pixelPop{
  0%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(4px) scale(.7);}
  15%{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0) scale(1);}
  80%{opacity:1;transform:translateY(-24px) scale(1);}
  100%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-32px) scale(1);}
}

.confetti-layer{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:80;}
.bill{
  position:absolute;top:-30px;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:12px;
  color:var(--gold);text-shadow:1px 1px 0 #5c3d00;
  animation:pixelFall 1.6s steps(16) forwards;
}
@keyframes pixelFall{to{transform:translateY(560px) rotate(180deg);opacity:0;}}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   03 SHOP
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
#screen-shop{
  padding:18px 14px 28px;
}
.shop-title{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:14px;
  color:var(--purple);
  text-shadow:2px 2px 0 #2d006b,0 0 12px rgba(159,95,255,.6);
  margin-bottom:4px;
}
.shop-sub{
  font-family:'VT323';font-size:18px;
  color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px;
}
.section-label{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:8px;
  color:var(--gold);
  box-shadow:inset 3px 0 0 0 var(--gold);
  padding-left:10px;margin:18px 0 10px;
  display:block;
}
.pack-row{display:flex;gap:10px;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:6px;}
.pack{
  min-width:108px;height:124px;flex-shrink:0;cursor:pointer;
  background:var(--panel2);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #3a2a5c,0 0 0 4px #000,3px 3px 0 #000;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;gap:8px;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:9px;text-align:center;padding:8px;
  border-radius:0;
}
.pack:hover{
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--purple),0 0 0 4px #000,5px 5px 0 #000;
  transform:translate(-2px,-2px);
}
.tabnav button.locked{color:var(--line);cursor:not-allowed;}
.tabnav button.locked:hover{color:var(--muted);}
.shop-locked{
  margin-top:24px;padding:28px 18px;text-align:center;background:var(--panel);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--line),4px 4px 0 #000;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8;
}
.shop-locked small{display:block;margin-top:10px;font-family:'VT323';font-size:18px;}
.shop-bar{
  display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;
  padding:10px 12px;background:#000;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--purple),3px 3px 0 #000;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:8.5px;line-height:2;color:var(--muted);
}
.shop-bar b{color:var(--gold);font-weight:normal;}
.shop-bar .open-btn{width:auto;margin:0;padding:10px 14px;font-size:9px;}
.shop-note{font-family:'VT323';font-size:16px;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 2px 0;}
.pack-row{gap:16px;padding:6px 6px 10px;flex-wrap:wrap;overflow:visible;}
.pack-col{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;width:170px;}
.pack{width:100%;height:auto;min-height:150px;gap:7px;padding:12px 8px;border:none;color:var(--text);}
.pack .pk-icon{font-size:24px;font-family:'VT323';}
.pack .pk-price{color:var(--gold);font-size:9px;}
.pack .pk-odds{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:4px 8px;font-size:7.5px;color:var(--muted);}
.pack .pk-desc{font-family:'VT323';font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);}
.pack.disabled,.pack:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed;transform:none;}
.pk-detail{font-family:'VT323';font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);}
.pk-detail summary{cursor:pointer;font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:6.5px;color:var(--cyan);}
.pk-detail ol{margin:6px 0 0;padding-left:0;list-style:none;max-height:180px;overflow-y:auto;}
.pk-detail li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;padding:1px 4px;}
.pk-detail li:nth-child(odd){background:var(--panel);}
.deck-list.shop-singles,.deck-list.shop-remove{justify-content:flex-start;max-height:none;overflow:visible;}
.shop-item{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
.buy-btn{
  border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:7px 10px;min-width:108px;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7.5px;background:var(--green-dim);color:var(--green);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--green2),2px 2px 0 #000;
}
.buy-btn:disabled{background:var(--panel);color:var(--muted);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--line);cursor:not-allowed;}
.shop-remove .card[data-shop-remove]{cursor:pointer;}
.shop-remove .card.picked{transform:translate(-2px,-5px);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--red),0 0 0 4px #000,5px 7px 0 #000;}
.shop-remove-btn{max-width:360px;}

/* 팩 개봉: 카드가 한 번 뒤집히는 것뿐 */
.flip-stage{perspective:600px;display:flex;justify-content:center;padding:10px 0 16px;}
.flip-card{position:relative;width:108px;height:158px;transform-style:preserve-3d;animation:cardFlip .6s steps(6) .2s both;}
@keyframes cardFlip{from{transform:rotateY(180deg);}to{transform:rotateY(0);}}
.flip-face{position:absolute;inset:0;backface-visibility:hidden;-webkit-backface-visibility:hidden;}
.flip-face .card{cursor:default;}
.flip-back{
  transform:rotateY(180deg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  background:var(--panel2);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--purple),0 0 0 4px #000,3px 3px 0 #000;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:22px;color:var(--purple);
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){ .flip-card{animation:none;} }

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   04 EVENT
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
#screen-event{
  min-height:calc(100vh - 40px);
  align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  padding:20px;
}
#screen-event.active{display:flex;}
.phone-noti{
  width:100%;max-width:360px;
  background:var(--panel);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--gold2),0 0 0 4px #000,6px 6px 0 #000;
  padding:18px;
}
.noti-headline{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:10px;
  color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:8px;
  text-shadow:1px 1px 0 #5c3d00;
}
.noti-body{
  font-family:'VT323';font-size:18px;
  color:var(--text);line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:16px;
}
.choice{
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--line),2px 2px 0 #000;
  padding:11px 13px;margin-bottom:10px;cursor:pointer;
  background:var(--panel2);
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:8px;
  transition:none;
}
.choice:hover{
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--gold2),4px 4px 0 #000;
  transform:translate(-2px,-2px);
}

.footnote{
  text-align:center;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;
  color:var(--muted);padding:18px 20px 10px;
}

.px-corner-box{position:relative;}
.px-corner-box::before,.px-corner-box::after{
  content:'';position:absolute;width:8px;height:8px;
  border-color:var(--cyan);border-style:solid;
  z-index:5;pointer-events:none;
}
.px-corner-box::before{top:2px;left:2px;border-width:2px 0 0 2px;}
.px-corner-box::after{bottom:2px;right:2px;border-width:0 2px 2px 0;}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   RUN STRUCTURE / 종목 시세 / 덱 · 턴 / 포지션
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
.hud{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;color:var(--cyan);
}
.day-track{flex:1;height:8px;background:#000;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--line);}
.day-fill{height:100%;width:0;background:var(--cyan);}

.target-line{
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:9px;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;color:var(--muted);
}
.target-track{height:6px;background:#000;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--line);margin-top:6px;}
.target-fill{height:100%;width:0;background:var(--gold2);}
.target-fill.done{background:var(--green);}

.quotes{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;margin-bottom:4px;}
.quote-row{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 64px 62px 50px;align-items:center;gap:6px;
  background:var(--panel);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--line);
  padding:5px 8px;font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;
}
.q-name{font-size:8px;color:var(--text);}
.q-name small{display:block;font-size:6px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px;}
.quote-row canvas{width:64px;height:18px;display:block;image-rendering:pixelated;}
.q-price,.q-chg{text-align:right;}
.q-tag{font-size:6px;margin-left:5px;}
.q-tag.hidden{color:var(--purple);}
.q-tag.up{color:var(--green);}
.q-tag.down{color:var(--red);}

/* 대상 지정 가능 */
.quote-row.targetable,.pos-item.targetable{
  cursor:pointer;background:rgba(255,215,0,.07);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--gold),3px 3px 0 #000;
}

/* 행동력 · 더미 */
.turn-bar{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:14px 0 8px;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;color:var(--muted);
}
.ap-pips{display:flex;gap:4px;}
.ap-pip{width:10px;height:10px;background:#000;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--gold2);}
.ap-pip.on{background:var(--gold);}
.ap-text{color:var(--gold);}
.pile-text{flex:1;text-align:right;}
.deck-btn,.back-btn{
  border:none;cursor:pointer;background:var(--panel);color:var(--cyan);
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;padding:5px 7px;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--line),2px 2px 0 #000;
}
.deck-btn:hover,.back-btn:hover{box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--cyan),2px 2px 0 #000;}

.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-bottom:8px;}
.chips:empty{display:none;}
.chip{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:6.5px;padding:4px 6px;background:#000;
  color:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--gold2);
}
.chip.buy{color:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--green2);}
.chip.short{color:var(--red);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--red2);}
.chip.mod{color:var(--purple);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--purple);}

.hand{gap:12px;padding:4px 4px 12px;}
.empty-note{
  width:100%;text-align:center;padding:14px;color:var(--muted);
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;
}

.open-btn{
  width:100%;padding:13px;margin:4px 0 6px;border:none;cursor:pointer;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.05em;
  background:var(--green-dim);color:var(--green);text-shadow:2px 2px 0 #000;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--green),0 0 0 4px #000,5px 5px 0 #000;
}
.open-btn:hover{transform:translate(-2px,-2px);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--green),0 0 0 4px #000,7px 7px 0 #000;}
.open-btn:disabled{
  cursor:default;transform:none;background:var(--panel);color:var(--muted);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--line),0 0 0 4px #000,3px 3px 0 #000;
}

/* 포지션 배지 · 예약주문 태그 */
.lev-badge{font-size:6px;padding:1px 3px;margin-left:5px;background:var(--gold2);color:#000;vertical-align:middle;}
.lev-badge.lev3{background:var(--red);color:var(--text);}
.lev-badge.short{background:var(--red2);color:var(--text);}
.o-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;margin-top:5px;}
.o-tag{font-size:5.5px;padding:2px 3px;background:#000;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--line);color:var(--muted);}
.o-tag.stop{color:var(--red);}
.o-tag.take{color:var(--green);}
.o-tag.trail{color:var(--cyan);}
.o-tag.hodl{color:var(--cyan);}
.o-tag.diamond{color:var(--gold);}
.ratio{font-size:6.5px;margin-top:4px;}
.ratio.safe{color:var(--gold);}
.ratio.danger{color:var(--red);animation:blink .6s step-end infinite;}
.positions-wrap{max-height:240px;}
.sell-btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed;transform:none;}

.toast-layer{
  position:fixed;top:48px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:95;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;width:min(480px,92vw);pointer-events:none;
}
.toast{
  background:#000;color:var(--cyan);
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7.5px;line-height:1.7;padding:8px 10px;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--cyan),3px 3px 0 #000;
  animation:toastIn 2.6s steps(13) forwards;
}
.toast.bad{color:var(--red);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--red),3px 3px 0 #000;}
.toast.good{color:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--green2),3px 3px 0 #000;}
.toast.warn{color:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--gold2),3px 3px 0 #000;}
@keyframes toastIn{0%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-6px);}8%{opacity:1;transform:none;}85%{opacity:1;}100%{opacity:0;}}

.overlay{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:90;background:rgba(0,0,0,.84);
  display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px;
}
.overlay.show{display:flex;}
.overlay-box{
  width:100%;max-width:440px;max-height:92vh;overflow-y:auto;
  background:var(--panel);text-align:center;padding:18px;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--gold2),0 0 0 4px #000,6px 6px 0 #000;
}
.ov-title{font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:8px;}
.ov-sub{font-family:'VT323';font-size:19px;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.3;}
.ov-stats{
  text-align:left;background:#000;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--line);
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7.5px;line-height:2.3;color:var(--muted);
  padding:8px 10px;margin-bottom:12px;
}
.ov-stats b{float:right;color:var(--text);font-weight:normal;}
.ov-btn{
  width:100%;padding:12px;margin-top:8px;border:none;cursor:pointer;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:9px;
  background:var(--green-dim);color:var(--green);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--green2),4px 4px 0 #000;
}
.ov-btn:hover{transform:translate(-2px,-2px);}
.ov-btn.alt{background:var(--panel2);color:var(--muted);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--line),4px 4px 0 #000;}
.ov-btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed;transform:none;}
.ov-cards,.deck-list{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;justify-content:center;padding:6px 4px 12px;}
.deck-list{max-height:46vh;overflow-y:auto;}
.pile-title{font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;color:var(--gold);text-align:left;margin:10px 0 6px;}

/* 카드 도감 */
#screen-collection{padding:18px 14px 28px;}
.coll-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;}
.coll-grid{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;padding:6px 4px 10px;}
.coll-grid .card,.deck-list .card{cursor:default;}
.coll-grid .card:hover,.deck-list .card:not([data-remove]):hover{transform:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--cc),0 0 0 4px #000,3px 3px 0 #000;}
.deck-list .card[data-remove]{cursor:pointer;}

.cabinet.shake{animation:shake .4s steps(6);}
@keyframes shake{0%,100%{transform:none;}20%{transform:translate(-4px,2px);}40%{transform:translate(4px,-2px);}60%{transform:translate(-3px,-1px);}80%{transform:translate(3px,1px);}}
.red-flash{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:85;pointer-events:none;background:rgba(255,26,60,.25);animation:fadeOut .5s steps(5) forwards;}
@keyframes fadeOut{to{opacity:0;}}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   DESKTOP (가로) 레이아웃 — 901px 이상
   게임 영역은 16:10 고정, 뷰포트 안에 letterbox로 맞춘다.
   화면이 16:10보다 넓으면 좌우에, 좁으면 위아래에 배경이 보인다.
   900px 이하는 위의 기존 세로 스택 그대로.
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
:root{
  --cab-ratio-w:16;
  --cab-ratio-h:10;
  --cab-max-w:90vw;   /* 폭 상한: 16:9 모니터에서 높이 100vh를 채우면 ≈90% */
  --cab-max-h:100vh;  /* 높이 상한 */
  --cab-w:min(var(--cab-max-w), calc(var(--cab-max-h) * var(--cab-ratio-w) / var(--cab-ratio-h)));
  --cab-h:calc(var(--cab-w) * var(--cab-ratio-h) / var(--cab-ratio-w));
}

@media (min-width: 901px){
  html,body{height:100%;overflow:hidden;}
  body{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}

  .cabinet{
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;
    width:var(--cab-w);
    aspect-ratio:var(--cab-ratio-w) / var(--cab-ratio-h);
    max-width:var(--cab-max-w);max-height:var(--cab-max-h);
    min-height:0;margin:0;
    border:3px solid var(--line);
  }
  .tabnav{flex:none;}
  .tabnav button{font-size:8px;padding:11px 4px;}
  .footnote{display:none;}

  /* 화면마다 게임 영역 안에서만 스크롤 */
  .screen{min-height:0;}
  .screen.active{flex:1;min-height:0;overflow-y:auto;}
  #screen-event.active{display:flex;}
  #screen-title{max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;width:100%;}
  #screen-shop,#screen-collection{padding:22px 28px 28px;}

  /* ── TR룸: 상단 HUD 바 + 좌(시장) / 우(손패·포지션) ── */
  #screen-play.active{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr);
    grid-template-rows:auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    grid-template-areas:"top top" "left right";
    gap:12px 16px;
    padding:12px 16px 14px;
    min-height:600px;           /* 너무 낮은 화면이면 안에서 스크롤 */
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .play-top{
    grid-area:top;
    display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:stretch;gap:10px 14px;
  }
  .play-left,.play-right{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:0;min-width:0;}
  .play-left{grid-area:left;}
  .play-right{grid-area:right;}

  /* 상단 바 구성: 타이틀·장세 | 주차·일자 | 순자산·목표 | 현금·대출·확정·이자 */
  .play-top .hdr{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;gap:7px;margin:0;}
  .play-top .hud{flex:1 1 240px;min-width:220px;margin:0;align-self:center;white-space:nowrap;}
  .play-top .balance-main{flex:0 1 270px;min-width:230px;margin:0;padding:8px 12px;}
  .play-top .balance-main .total{font-size:16px;margin-top:4px;}
  .play-top .target-line{margin-top:6px;}
  .play-top .assets-grid{
    flex:0 1 560px;min-width:420px;margin:0;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));gap:8px;
  }
  .play-top .asset-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:6px;}
  .play-top .asset-card .val{font-size:10px;}

  /* 왼쪽: 뉴스 → 지수 차트(남는 높이 전부) → 종목 시세판 */
  .play-left .news-banner{flex:none;}
  .play-left .chart-box{flex:1 1 auto;height:auto;min-height:140px;margin-bottom:4px;}
  .play-left .section-title{flex:none;margin-top:10px;}
  .play-left .quotes{flex:none;}
  .play-left .quote-row{grid-template-columns:1fr 96px 70px 56px;padding:4px 8px;}
  .play-left .quote-row canvas{width:96px;}

  /* 오른쪽: 행동력·더미 → 손패 → 장 시작 → 포지션(남는 높이 전부) → 전량 매도 */
  .play-right .turn-bar{margin:0 0 6px;flex:none;}
  .play-right .chips{flex:none;}
  .play-right .section-title{flex:none;margin:8px 0 6px;}
  .play-right .hand{flex:none;padding:6px 6px 12px;}
  .play-right .open-btn{flex:none;margin:2px 0 4px;padding:11px;}
  .play-right .positions-wrap{flex:1 1 0;min-height:70px;max-height:none;margin-bottom:10px;padding:2px;}
  .play-right .sell-all-btn{flex:none;padding:11px;}

  /* 알림은 상단 HUD를 가리지 않도록 왼쪽 차트 위에 */
  .toast-layer{
    top:calc((100vh - var(--cab-h)) / 2 + var(--cab-h) * 0.28);
    left:calc((100vw - var(--cab-w)) / 2 + 30px);
    transform:none;
    width:calc(var(--cab-w) * 0.4);
  }
  .hand{scroll-snap-type:x proximity;scroll-padding:0 6px;}
  .hand .card{scroll-snap-align:start;}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- pixel bg canvas -->
<canvas id="candleBg"></canvas>

<!-- ambient floating bg stock charts layer -->
<div id="bgChartContainer"></div>

<div class="cabinet">
  <div class="tabnav">
    <button class="active" data-s="title">▶01 타이틀</button>
    <button data-s="play">02 TR룸</button>
    <button data-s="shop">03 암시장</button>
    <button data-s="event">04 찌라시</button>
  </div>

  <!-- ====== 01 TITLE ====== -->
  <section id="screen-title" class="screen active">
    <div class="eyebrow">★ "한강물이 따뜻한가요?" ★</div>
    <div class="badge-wrap">
      <div class="jibu-badge">떡상<span>기원부적</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="title-main">풀매수 기원단</div>
    <div class="title-hodl">HODL or Die</div>
    <div class="title-tagline">시작부터 <b>상한가 가즈아!</b></div>

    <div class="menu">
      <button id="startBtn">▶ 영끌 출격
        <small>GAME START — 계좌 개설 후 즉시 몰빵</small>
      </button>
      <button id="collectionBtn">▷ 손절 기계
        <small>COLLECTION — 해금한 카드 · 유물 · 밈 도감</small>
      </button>
      <button>▷ 환경 설정
        <small>SETTINGS — 사운드 · 언어 · 심박수 안정화</small>
      </button>
      <button>▷ 파산 기록
        <small>STATS — 역대 반대매매 히스토리</small>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="ticker-wrap">
      <div class="ticker" id="tickerText"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ====== 02 GAMEPLAY ====== -->
  <section id="screen-play" class="screen">
    <!-- 가로 화면: 상단 HUD 바 / 왼쪽 시장 / 오른쪽 손패·포지션 (900px 이하는 세로 스택) -->
    <div class="play-top">
      <div class="hdr">
        <h2>▌ 도파민 TR룸</h2>
        <span class="state-tag" id="marketStateTag">■ NORMAL</span>
      </div>

      <div class="hud">
        <span id="roundText">WEEK 1/8</span>
        <div class="day-track"><div class="day-fill" id="dayFill"></div></div>
        <span id="dayText">DAY 1/5 · 장전</span>
      </div>

      <div class="balance-main px-corner-box">
        <div class="label">▌ NET ASSETS · 순자산</div>
        <div class="total" id="totalAssets">₩ 10,000만</div>
        <div class="target-line"><span id="targetText">WEEK 1 목표</span><span id="targetPct">0%</span></div>
        <div class="target-track"><div class="target-fill" id="targetFill"></div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="assets-grid">
        <div class="asset-card">
          <div class="label" id="cashLabel">■ CASH</div>
          <div class="val highlight" id="availableCash">₩ 10,000만</div>
        </div>
        <div class="asset-card">
          <div class="label">■ 대출·대차</div>
          <div class="val" id="debtVal">₩ 0만</div>
        </div>
        <div class="asset-card">
          <div class="label">■ REALIZED</div>
          <div class="val" id="realizedPnL">₩ 0만</div>
        </div>
        <div class="asset-card">
          <div class="label">■ 누적 이자</div>
          <div class="val" id="interestVal">₩ 0만</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

